WEBVTT

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:41.600
So, where are you taking me tomorrow?

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:44.190
Well?

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:48.730
Come on, where?

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:57.950
I walk unsteadily on paths to nowhere

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:02.080
wondering what I should do right now.

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:08.540
I play the song you like on the car stereo

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:13.090
with the volume up and my feelings crystallized

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:18.720
driving on streets with no crossroads or signals

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:24.140
with a speed that will catch up with you.

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:28.610
So faraway - let's run!

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:34.900
And let's not bother with the breaks - full throttle.

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:39.200
Oh someday - one of these days

00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:44.290
You'll be at my place where nobody can find you.

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:50.380
Whenever you suffer a breakdown one can't see

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:55.970
depend on me for your repairs.

00:01:56.220 --> 00:02:00.350
So faraway - let's run!

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:06.560
We'll reset and start again - even at our limit.

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:10.860
Oh someday - one of these days

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:16.900
If I'm with you we'll find our dream.

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:27.160
Love Moans on an Arctic Night

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:38.510
Welcome.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:42.470
I'll have a gin fizz.

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:43.600
Coming right up.

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:47.060
You're pretty cold.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:49.810
We're done here.

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:54.360
Wh... What are you implying?

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:56.530
It's time for you to leave.

00:02:56.940 --> 00:03:01.200
The nerve! That's not why I'm with you!

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:08.000
What exactly do you think I am? Don't misjudge me!

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:30.310
Thanks for waiting.

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:39.490
<i>You think you're the only woman I got?</i>

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:47.580
<i>You think you're the only woman I got?</i>
<i>You think you're the only woman I got?</i>

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:50.710
<i>You think you're the only woman I got?</i>

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:05.010
<i>You meant nothing to me from the start, so get off your high horse.</i>

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:12.520
<i>I only married you just get at the
inheritance your parents left you.</i>

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:17.150
<i>Now that it's all pissed away, you're useless to me.</i>

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:21.650
<i>Now here you are rushing with your wifely affections.</i>

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:26.200
<i>A broad with half a clue up her ass wouldn't end up here looking so damn stupid.</i>

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:31.830
<i>What? Got something to say?</i>

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:37.750
<i>You think you're the only woman I got?</i>

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:39.840
<i>Huh?!</i>

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:06.780
Miss?

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:08.240
Miss!

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:10.080
Miss!

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:14.830
I'm sorry.

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:17.420
I was feeling a little tipsy.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.960
I'm okay now.

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:22.710
A... Are you sure?

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:43.860
Miss, my sincerest apologies.

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:49.240
There won't be any taxis arriving due to a strike.

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:54.250
We wish to take you to the airport via our hotel car...

00:05:55.960 --> 00:06:01.170
Well, the truth is there is another guest we will also be taking to the airport.

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:04.630
If you are kind enough to join him...

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:07.260
I don't mind.

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:09.220
Thank you very much.

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:15.520
So, if you will follow me...

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:38.540
Thank you very much.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:50.840
Too bad you have to leave on a day like this.

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:53.930
Still, it's nice that you're able to change scenery.

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:56.430
Yeah...

00:06:57.020 --> 00:07:02.730
Funny thing about my wife, she wants to go on a trip every time it rains.

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:05.610
She watches the rain and asks me to take her somewhere.

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:07.740
I swear, she's a strange one.

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:12.450
So where's your destination?

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:15.950
I'm... going back home to Norway.

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:18.660
Oh, sounds nice!

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:38.980
Uh, sir.

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:41.270
Please stop here.

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:43.600
Huh? Okay.

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:51.030
What's wrong, Miss?

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:53.610
I'll get off here.

00:07:53.610 --> 00:07:56.530
Please just take my luggage.

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:59.620
But it's raining out there.

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:01.460
It's fine.

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:05.670
I just want to take a little stroll... in the rain.

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:07.170
Okay...

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:10.130
Please don't take this the wrong way.

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:12.130
Really.

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:16.140
I just feel like taking a walk.

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:20.520
It's okay.

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:26.770
Still, Miss, it's pouring and it's still a long way to the airport.

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:28.690
Yes. Thank you.

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:54.470
That's sure bizarre, taking a walk in this rain.

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:07.400
<i>Now get out!</i>

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:11.280
<i>I told you to get out!</i>

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:14.150
<i>You still don't get it?</i>

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:15.650
<i>Let me go!</i>

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.330
<i>Get out!</i>

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:25.540
<i>I said let go!</i>

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:59.240
<i>The defendant will serve six months in prison.</i>

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:05.040
<i>However, due to attenuating circumstances, I will grant a one-year suspended sentence.</i>

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:10.250
Yes?

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:13.340
Is this the landlord?

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:17.380
Yes... you can have all the furniture in my apartment.

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:22.220
When I return back home, I plan to buy new ones.

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:26.850
Yes, I'm not coming back. Goodbye.

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:01.260
Attention all guests.

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:07.730
Flight 201 to Norway will be heading for the runway after all the passengers have been seated.

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:12.690
Please wait and fasten your seat belts.

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:31.420
About before...

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:34.590
It's fine.

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:13.580
Flight 201's entry approach is too elevated. What's going on?

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:17.750
Control tower! Control tower! This is Flight 201!

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:21.590
Flight 201, this is the control tower!

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:26.100
This is the control tower! What's
wrong? Your approach is too high!

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:30.470
The landing gears are stuck! We're currently checking the hydraulics!

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:33.440
We will circle the plane until further notice, over!

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:36.020
This is bad.

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:40.110
Get ready to spray the runway with the fire-extinguishing agent.

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:43.900
Have the fire engines and ambulances on standby! Move!

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:52.870
Wh... What's going on?

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:55.870
We've been flying in circles for a while now!

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:58.960
Something's wrong! Something's definitely wrong!

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:00.840
A malfunction?

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:01.460
Is it true?

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:05.470
Hey, what's going on? Hey!

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:08.350
Everyone, there's nothing wrong.

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:12.470
Please remain calm, return to your seats and await our landing.

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:15.230
You guys always say that!

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:21.230
I myself survived an accident by the skin of my teeth, so believe me - I know!

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:24.320
You all fed us the same story back then.

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:28.240
But I ended up being one of just a few survivors.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:33.250
So enough of your sweet talk and tell us what's really going on with this plane!

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:36.870
Th... They're currently inspecting the hydraulics system.

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:39.750
We will be experiencing some turbulence, but you will all be safe!

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:42.300
We'll be landing shortly.

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:46.760
So please return to your seats and fasten your seat belts. I implore you!

00:13:56.730 --> 00:14:00.400
If we shake that aircraft, the landing gears should engage.

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:04.030
It's the crudest method we've got in the bag, but it has a high success rate.

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:06.490
If that doesn't work...

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:09.990
...then we'll have to do a belly landing.

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.090
You look like...

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:28.680
You look like you're not even part of this.

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:33.010
Even though you're on a plane that might be malfunctioning.

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:37.640
I'm also thinking the same thing about you.

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:44.230
I... don't care whether I live or die.

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:46.280
You don't mean that.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:46.940
Eh?

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:52.410
If you actually think that, you wouldn't be trembling.

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:02.790
Thinking you want to die, depart
from this world, and be at peace...

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:08.010
...is simply your heart saying you want to live an enjoyable life.

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:11.550
You're not completely numb to your emotions.

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:20.270
Attention everyone, this is your pilot
Steven with an important announcement.

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:25.820
I regret to inform you that due to a malfunction with the hydraulics, the landing gears are not engaging.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:32.030
This plane will shortly attempt a belly landing.

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:33.410
Belly landing! What?

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:35.030
Did he say a belly landing?

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:37.200
A belly landing?

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:41.290
Everyone, settle down!

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:45.960
We are currently creating the most optimal conditions for our landing.

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:48.420
Your lives will not be at risk.

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:52.340
However, please fasten your safety belt.

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:57.260
Please remove all fountain pens, tie tacks and other dangerous objects from your immediate vicinities.

00:15:58.270 --> 00:16:03.350
Once you're finished, please remain
calm and at ease during our attempt.

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:37.930
<i>I want to live!</i>

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:25.810
We're...

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:28.400
We're alive.

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:31.440
How did it go?

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:32.820
Hurray!

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:35.360
We're all right!

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:37.780
We're saved!

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:38.870
Yeah!

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:40.030
We're alive!

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:40.830
Thank God!

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:04.330
So this is goodbye?

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:29.830
What the- boss!

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:30.700
Boss!

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:32.080
Boss!!

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:07.870
I'm sorry.

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:11.870
I ended up following you.

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:21.380
But... it's fine.

00:22:40.830 --> 00:22:45.960
I enjoyed the little things.

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:53.180
I loved when you gave me a flower every day

00:22:53.930 --> 00:22:59.270
instead of just one big bouquet

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:04.110
of flowers.

00:23:06.190 --> 00:23:11.740
It was like a romance novel.

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:16.330
Surely someday... just kidding.

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:19.710
I had a dream.

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:25.420
Your face shined eternally.

00:23:26.250 --> 00:23:32.010
Because I think of you all the time.

00:23:32.430 --> 00:23:37.560
I'm sorry, but on a lonely night like this

00:23:38.520 --> 00:23:44.060
I'm remembering you, but

00:23:44.360 --> 00:23:48.650
I won't cry like I did that day.

00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:51.820
I won't.

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:08.000
Golgo was cast as the leading role in a "semi-documentary."

00:24:08.960 --> 00:24:15.010
The director will place Golgo in a trap in order to film his sniping from beginning to end.

00:24:16.300 --> 00:24:20.890
The tapes will also roll on the tragedy involving the leading actress.

00:24:21.180 --> 00:24:26.310
Casting

00:24:21.640 --> 00:24:24.600
Next time on Golgo 13: Casting.

00:24:25.270 --> 00:24:29.150
Don't stand behind him, if you value your life.
